# npm
dist
# Anchored: this is the top-level build output directory. Unanchored, `web` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which silently untracked `tesserafin-design/web/` — a source directory that
# builds depend on. That failure is invisible locally (the file is on disk) and only surfaces as a
# broken build from a fresh clone, so keep the leading slash.
/web
